OL,3,GNEWSAThree teens charged after boy
OL,4,Astabbed in city
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree teenagers have been charged
OL,7,Ffollowing a stabbing in the Yardley
OL,8,Farea of Birmingham.
OL,10,FA teenage boy was found with serious
OL,11,Finjuries at about 14:10 GMT on Tuesday
OL,12,Fon Yew Tree Lane and remained in a
OL,13,Fstable condition in hospital, police
OL,14,Fsaid.
OL,16,FTwo boys, aged 14, were charged with
OL,17,Fwounding while a 15-year-old boy was
OL,18,Fcharged with wounding and two counts of
OL,19,Fpossession of a bladed article. They
OL,20,Fwere remanded into custody and were set
OL,21,Fto appear at Birmingham Magistrates'
OL,22,FCourt on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
